<p>The IBA‑approved Lorry Receipts (LR/Bilty) provide a legal trail for the cargo, confirming the consignor, consignee, and the goods’ description. These documents are mandatory for customs compliance and tax audit purposes.</p>

<p>In addition to paperwork, risk coverage is paramount. A 100 % declared‑value IRDAI marine transit insurance protects against accidental collision, theft, or unforeseen delays.</p>
<p>This policy covers the entire value of the goods, ensuring you are compensated even if the shipment is damaged or delayed due to weather, mechanical failure, or other mishaps. The coverage is tailored for long‑haul routes such as the 1,200‑km stretch from Kolkata to Bhubaneswar, where the risk of collision or delay is higher.</p></div>
